      "message": "When building this for virtual aarch64 devices:\n\n```\ntools/bazel run //common-modules/virtual-device:virtual_device_aarch64_dist\n```\n\nI get the following error:\n\n```\nThese symbols are missing from the symbol list and are not available at runtime for unsigned modules:\n  snd_ctl_add required by [\u0027virtio_snd.ko\u0027]\n  snd_ctl_new1 required by [\u0027virtio_snd.ko\u0027]\n  snd_ctl_notify required by [\u0027virtio_snd.ko\u0027]\nTarget //common-modules/virtual-device:virtual_device_aarch64_dist failed to build\n```\n\nThis can be fixed by running:\n\n```\ntools/bazel run //common-modules/virtual-device:virtual_device_aarch64_abi_update_symbol_list\n```\n\nWhich updates `kernel/common/android/abi_gki_aarch64_virtual_device` accordingly. Perhaps that should be submitted as a separate change in the same topic?",
